# SWM recovery-first mode

When working under `swm-recovery/` or when the user invokes SWM extraction
commands:

1. Treat the task as extraction, not verification, approval, or canonization.
2. Do not reject material for conflict, age, experimental status, or missing
   governance labels.
3. Do not resolve conflicts; set resolution to
   `DEFERRED — EXTRACTION PHASE`.
4. Do not invent missing prompts, architecture, or business facts.
5. Prefer `REFERENCE-ONLY`, `INCOMPLETE`, `UNCERTAIN`, or Gap Register entries
   over speculation.
6. Isolate SWM business material from legal, medical, crisis, or private
   relationship material.
7. Process only supplied or specifically authorized sources.
8. Use exactly one evidence label per extracted item.
